      "statement": "MHFC computes RWA under both the Standardized and Advanced approaches and uses the lower of each ratio (the Collins Floor), currently the Standardized approach, so Standardized RWA is the binding denominator; at 31 Dec 2025 Standardized RWA was 652,800 versus Advanced 618,300.",
