      "statement": "The Regulatory Reporting API (API-16) is the governed, general-ledger-reconciled source of RWA and capital (endpoints /rwa/{asOf} and /capital/{asOf}), restricted to internal consumers with regulatory:read scope, with quarter-end data locked by day 25; it feeds the MDL-CAP-003 starting CET1 and RWA, FR Y-9C/FFIEC 101 filings and Pillar 3.",
