      "id": "claim_8979fcf171b14c37a704e5e2d0334a87",
      "statement": "MDL-CAP-003 projects only total Standardized RWA over nine quarters via RWA(t)=RWA(t-1)x(1+quarterly growth) from the 668,400 starting value (API-16), using a flat 1.0% quarterly growth in the baseline and a scenario growth path of +2.2%, +1.5%, +0.8%, +0.4%, 0%, -0.2%, -0.4%, -0.4%, -0.4% under severely adverse, yielding 731,019 (baseline) and 691,920 (stress) at Q3 2028; the stress path peaks at 701,694.",
