      "id": "claim_18ccd8f88de84a658d92715b068605aa",
      "statement": "In the capital planning model, projected RWA is the denominator of the CET1 ratio (guarded to return 0 when RWA is 0), drives dollar headroom against the 13.0% management target and 10.2% requirement, and the indicative SCB uses four quarters of dividends divided by starting RWA (0.94%) plus the 2.24% peak-to-trough decline, floored at 2.5%, giving 3.18%.",
